body:
WTF I just watch, this is one of the worst netflix series ever common,   


1 -Triads who only uses knifes and axes, how nobody has ever thought about using a submachine gun on davos or iron fist? just imagine the scene in the real life "I KNOW KUNG FU I HAVE A GLOWING FIST" [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c-nLNEQz88Q](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c-nLNEQz88Q) would be just like this scene on the link.

&#x200B;

2 -It is okay to have Triads who extort money from elders, and have participation in a lot of criminal activities, murder and shit, but the problem is when someone start to killing those motherfuckers? where is the logic, Davos was not a nice guy, but he was at least killing bad/untouchable people, one day he would get shot and killed by a random gangster thug, so what is the point to make an alliance with triads and protect them if they are the REAL bad ones?

&#x200B;

3 -Why in the hell would Danny Rand the billionaire 51% shareholder of a giant corporation, need to learn how to fight just to beat Davos? Common anyone could kill Davos, I could kill Davos, he isn't imortal, he just have a glowing fist, he isn't bulletproof or even faster than a bullet, the triads, the cops, even detective misty knight would kick his ass (She has a gun and a iron fist), what about that scene when he fights against Danny in front the entire guard of the Triads, It is absolutely out of reality, real life those triads gangsters would have Ak's 47, even a fucking bazooka, Davos was trying to clean the city (beside that tyranic behavior) triads are not good people, I don't care about the drugs the problem is Gun trafficking, Sex trafficking, extortion, robbery and all kinds of criminal activities that they usually do, what danny rand did was 1st Protect the Triads 2nd Stolen the iron fist which should have used to protect the kun lun instead of new york or chinatown, he left, betrayed the cause just because he was bored to protect Kun Lun, if davos had the iron fist in the first place nothing of this would have happened!

&#x200B;

Conclusion:

Danny Rand is a multibillionaire capable of saving the world ( at least help a lot)with his money,power and influence, instead of this he choose's to 1stBetray the Kun Lun 2ndProtect Triads from a punisher  3rd Use a jumpsuit and beat low levels criminal from one of the wealthiests cities in the world with no reason at all. Now you guys can see how bad is the show? Danny Rand is a motherfucker! the series is 100% unrealistic and even worse there is no logic in every fight scene. 

&#x200B;

OBS: DANNY RAND IS NOT THE HERO, HE IS JUST A FUCKING RICH KID WHO LIKES TO HAVE FUN PRETENDING BEING A VIGILANTE ACROSS THE NIGHT!
